QUESTION BANK
-------------
The graded question bank — the exercises, answer keys, hints and theory
summaries actually used to assess students — lives in a separate private
repository. It is withheld deliberately: students must not be able to read the
answers. Nothing under content-private/ is part of this repository, and no
licence is granted to it here.

Everything this repository does ship is covered by the Apache-2.0 licence
above, including the content files:

  src/content/worlds/M01.demo.json   a ten-exercise demonstration module,
                                     written for this purpose, with its own
                                     keys, hints and explanations
  src/content/recaps/M01.demo.json   the matching demonstration theory recap
  src/content/equipmentInfo.ts       instrument specifications, working
                                     principles and glossary (RO/EN)

Those three are original to this project and are not drawn from the graded
bank, so a fork may redistribute them under Apache-2.0 like any other file
here. The boundary is the directory: content-private/ is withheld, the rest
is licensed.

